{"id":"e_tonnant","lemma":"étonnant","pos":"adj","rank":1743,"glosses":["amazing; surprising; astonishing"],"ipa":"/e.tɔ.nɑ̃/","forms":{"feminine":"étonnante","masculinePlural":"étonnants","femininePlural":"étonnantes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-%C3%A9tonnant.wav","formAudio":{"étonnante":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-%C3%A9tonnante.wav","étonnants":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9tonnants.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un endroit assez étonnant.","en":"This is a pretty amazing place.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"place, spot"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},null]},{"text":"Vous êtes des gens étonnants.","en":"You people are amazing.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"people"},null]},{"text":"La réponse était assez étonnante.","en":"The answer was pretty astonishing.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"retort, comeback"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to a sufficient or…"},null]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas étonnant.","en":"This is no surprise.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Pas étonnant que personne ne vous apprécie.","en":"No wonder no one likes you.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to appreciate","l":"apprécier"}]}]}